  "notes": "The six-copy value of Bravyi, Smith, and Smolin, chi(|H>^6) <= 7, behind the 2^{0.47n} figure (log_2(7)/6 = 0.468); they conjectured it optimal, and Qassim, Pashayan, and Gosset later gave rank 6, which is the cell's record. Kept on the ledger as the historical value with a witness: found here by the package's annealer (search_decomposition.py, target qubit_real, seed 3, starting rank 7) and verified in exact arithmetic. Two runs starting at rank 6 (seeds 1 and 2) both stopped at residual 0.101, so the annealer did not find the rank-6 cat-state decomposition on its own."
